1) What is Pagination
      Pagination is a technique used to retieve data page by page instead of loading all records at once from the database.
                                    or
      Pagination is a feature in Spring Boot used to fetch large amounts of data in smaller chunks called oages. It improbes performance 
      and reduce memory usage. Spring Data JPA provides pagination using pageable, PageRequest, and Page interfaces.

2) DTO  ( Data Transfer Object )
      DTO is an object used to transfer data betwee client and server without exposing the actual entity class.
